# ClaudeBoost shared overrides for clean-rag (optional).
#
# Copy to ClaudeBoost/.env if you want machine-wide clean-rag config that
# applies whether clean-rag runs standalone or bundled here. The real .env is
# gitignored.
#
# This is the LOWER precedence file. clean-rag/.env overrides anything here, and
# a real env var in ~/.claude/settings.json overrides both:
#   settings.json  >  clean-rag/.env  >  ClaudeBoost/.env  >  defaults
#
# Most people never need this file. Put a value here only when you want it to
# apply as a shared default that clean-rag/.env can still override per checkout.
# See clean-rag/.env.example for the full list of keys and defaults.

# CLEAN_RAG_PORT=8613
# CLEAN_RAG_WEB_SEARCH=true
